## 📁 Repository Structure

```text
.
├── database/
│   ├── schema.sql    # Table definitions (CREATE TABLE statements)
│   └── seed.sql      # Dummy/Sample data inserts (INSERT INTO statements)
├── docs/
│   └── images/
│       └── schema-visualizer.png  # Supabase ER/Schema Diagram
└── README.md         # Documentation
